<div class="side-card">

<h3>🎯 Pick Winners Before You Apply</h3>

<p>
Use this quick screening system.
</p>

<div style="margin-top:10px;">

<div class="score-row" style="color:#3E2A18;border-bottom:1px solid #E8DCCB;">
<span>Clearly eligible?</span>
<span style="color:#7B5A36;">YES</span>
</div>

<div class="score-row" style="color:#3E2A18;border-bottom:1px solid #E8DCCB;">
<span>Strong mission fit?</span>
<span style="color:#7B5A36;">YES</span>
</div>

<div class="score-row" style="color:#3E2A18;border-bottom:1px solid #E8DCCB;">
<span>Can provide evidence?</span>
<span style="color:#7B5A36;">YES</span>
</div>

<div class="score-row" style="color:#3E2A18;border-bottom:1px solid #E8DCCB;">
